# Patterns scrubbed from issue titles before they land in
# docs/backlog-snapshot.md (one Oniguruma regex per line; matches become
# [redacted]). Emails, UUIDs and home-directory paths are always scrubbed;
# list anything else that must not appear in public here: client names,
# private repo names, hostnames.
watch-ads-not-working[A-Za-z0-9._-]*
